Package: lagprotest
Title: Lagged Procrustean Randomization Test for Multivariate Time Series
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo B.", "Provete", email = "dbprovete@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0097-0651"))
Description: Extends the Procrustean randomization test (PROTEST) to
    ordered multivariate series. Concordance between two configurations
    is scanned across candidate temporal lags, and significance at each
    lag is assessed by permutation, either by cyclic shifts of the full
    series (preserving temporal autocorrelation) or by free permutation
    of rows. Returns the lag profile, the lag of maximal concordance and
    per-observation Procrustes residuals.
